<section class="faq bg-grey faqWrapBox">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="headingWrap flexbox">
            <div class="headingsLeft">

                <h2 class="go-HighlightHeading mt10">
                    Frequently Asked <br class="mob-hide"> <span class="fr-HeadingItalic">Questions</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

        </div>
        <div class="faqWrapper ">
            <nav class="navigationWrapper ">
                <ul class="tabs faqtabs pdl">
                    <li class="active" data-rel="tab11">Programme Overview</li>
                    <li class="" data-rel="tab33">Eligibility & Admissions</li>
                    <li class="" data-rel="tab44">Learning & Outcomes</li>
                    <li class="" data-rel="tab55">Cohort & Faculty</li>
                    <li class="" data-rel="tab66">Format & Delivery</li>
                    <li class="" data-rel="tab77">Safety, Code of Conduct & Logistics</li>
                </ul>
            </nav>

            <div class="content-section">
                <div id="tab11" class="content active">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 active" data-rel="tab-a-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is PGP Bharat?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer active" id="tab-a-1">PGP Bharat is a 6-month immersion-led programme where
                            India becomes your classroom—combining travel, business and cultural immersions, In Class
                            and Out Class experiences, and hands-on learning.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How many cities and immersions does the programme cover?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-2">Students travel across 20+ cities and engage in 25+ immersive
                            experiences covering industries,
                            enterprises and cultural sites.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is PGP Bharat an MBA equivalent?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-3">PGP Bharat is a Post Graduate Programme (PGP) that emphasizes
                            experiential learning in business education. While not an MBA, it offers one-of-its-kind
                            business exposure and practical learning that no other course in the country currently
                            provides.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Will I get a degree after completing PGP Bharat?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-4">You will receive a Post Graduate Programme (PGP)
                            certification, similar to the PGP-TBM offered at Masters’ Union.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-5">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What will I learn in the programme?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-5">Through industry immersions, CXO interactions, and cultural
                            experiences, you’ll gain real-world exposure to how business works in India. You’ll shape
                            your digital identity in the Creator Challenge, build hands-on skills by solving real
                            business problems in One Day Consultancy Challenges, launch your own venture in the Venture
                            Initiation Programme and hone your entrepreneurial skills through the Dropshipping
                            Challenge. Alongside, you’ll master business fundamentals across strategy, finance,
                            marketing, and technology while developing the perspective and self-awareness to grow as a
                            future leader.

                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-6">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is the programme structure?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-a-6">

                            <div class="detailsList faq-log">
                                <ul class="list">
                                    <li>
                                        <p>
                                            Term 0: Orientation at Gurugram Campus
                                        </p>
                                    </li>

                                    <li>
                                        <p>
                                            Term 1: Dropshipping Challenge as Out Class & In Class sessions
                                        </p>
                                    </li>

                                    <li>
                                        <p>Term 2: Travel-based Immersions and Creator Challenge & One Day Consultancy
                                            Challenges as Out Class
                                        </p>
                                    </li>

                                    <li>
                                        <p> Term 3: Venture Initiation Programme & In Class sessions
                                        </p>
                                    </li>

                                </ul>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div id="tab33" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What is the eligibility criteria?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-1">PGP Bharat is open to all candidates who
                            have completed their undergraduate degree or are graduating in April 2026 onwards.


                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Do I need prior work experience?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-2">No prior work experience is required. The
                            programme is designed for learners at different stages of their journey, but it is
                            especially recommended for those with a strong interest in business, travel, and
                            experiential learning.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How do I apply?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-3">Click <a href="/pgp-bharat-apply-now"
                                class="link-red"> Apply Now </a> on our website, fill out the online application form,
                            and start your transformative journey across India.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Are scholarships available for PGP Bharat?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-4"> Yes, we offer 5 types of scholarships to
                            support deserving students from different backgrounds and communities. You can explore the
                            details of each scholarship on our Admissions page.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-5">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> How can I avail a scholarship for PGP Bharat?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-5"> When filling out your application, you
                            can indicate interest in applying for a scholarship. Shortlisted candidates will be asked to
                            provide supporting documents or essays to demonstrate eligibility for specific scholarships.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-6">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Is there an age limit to apply for the programme?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-6">There is no upper age limit. However, the
                            programme is best suited for learners aged 20 to 28 seeking to combine business education
                            with travel and immersive experiences.</p>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="tab44" class="content">
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Will I get to network with industry leaders?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-1">Yes! You will learn and engage with 30+
                            CXOs and mentors from Fortune 500 companies, top unicorns, and emerging startups across
                            India.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Can I work on my own startup ideas during the programme?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-2">Absolutely. The programme encourages
                            entrepreneurial thinking, with opportunities to apply classroom and immersion learnings
                            directly to your personal ventures.

                        </p>


                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Will I get cultural exposure while learning business?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-3">Yes, cultural immersions are integrated at
                            every city stop, including heritage sites, local communities, and regional business
                            practices.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is a Million Dollar Portfolio?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-4">
                            <p>
                                As you take part in 16+ business immersions with leading companies, you’ll build a
                                portfolio through hands-on consultancy challenges and real evaluations by CXOs and
                                senior
                                leaders. This becomes your Million Dollar Portfolio, which is proof of the skills
                                and experiences you’ve gained.

                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-5">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is the Dropshipping Challenge?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-5">The Dropshipping Challenge is part of our
                            Out Class curriculum, where you set up your own online store and sell products without
                            holding inventory. You’ll learn how to source products, build websites, market them, and
                            make real sales.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-6">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What is the Creator Challenge?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-6">The Creator Challenge is designed to help
                            you build your personal brand. You’ll document your journey through photos, videos, and
                            stories while growing your presence on platforms like YouTube, Instagram, and LinkedIn.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-7">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How will the learning outcomes be assessed?

                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-7">Your progress will be evaluated through
                            hands-on assignments, Out Class Challenges, and active participation throughout the
                            programme. Assessments are designed in collaboration with industry partners, with feedback
                            and evaluations coming directly from CXOs and senior leaders. </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-8">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Will the programme help with placements or internships?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-8">PGP Bharat does not provide placements
                            or internships. However, students gain access to real opportunities through networking with
                            CXOs, collaborating with partner companies, and showcasing their Million Dollar Portfolio.
                            Many participants use the programme to transition into new roles, launch ventures, or gain
                            visibility in specific industries.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="tab55" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How many students will be in the cohort?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-1">Each cohort will have around 60–80
                            students, ensuring close interactions with mentors and meaningful peer-to-peer learning.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What kind of peer group can I expect?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-2">Students come from diverse academic and
                            professional backgrounds—ranging from engineering and business to arts and social
                            sciences—united by a passion for business, travel, and immersive learning.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Who teaches or mentors in the programme?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-3">The faculty includes CXOs, founders, and
                            industry leaders across sectors. You’ll also be mentored directly by executives from
                            Fortune 500 companies, unicorns, and startups during immersions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="tab66" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-f-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Are classes online or in-person?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-f-1"> The programme follows a blended format.
                            Immersions and key sessions take place in-person across different cities in India, while
                            select In Class and Out Class modules (such as workshops, challenges, and mentor sessions)
                            are conducted in hybrid mode for added flexibility.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div id="tab77" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How does the programme ensure decorum and discipline?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-1">We maintain a clear code of conduct, provide structured
                            schedules, and have dedicated male and female programme managers accompanying the cohort.
                            This ensures a safe, respectful, and professional environment throughout all travel, company
                            visits, and cultural immersions.

                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What does the programme fee include?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-2">The fee covers all core programme expenses. This includes
                            inter-city travel post orientation, local transport, select meals, and shared accommodation
                            at each location. It also covers access to immersions, workshops, and learning resources
                            provided during the journey. Personal expenses such as shopping, leisure activities, or
                            additional purchases are not included.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What kind of accommodation will be provided?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-3">Students stay in safe, secure, shared accommodations—typically
                            twin-sharing rooms in hotels, hostels, or serviced residences—arranged by Masters’ Union in
                            each city.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-g-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Does the programme include travel insurance and safety measures?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-g-4">Yes, every student is covered under travel insurance. Safety
                            is our top priority, and we work with certified professionals dedicated to ensuring the
                            well-being of all participants throughout the journey.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>

